---
name: Windows events from Fluent Bit Forward → OCSF
description: |
  Receive Windows Event Log events collected by Fluent Bit's `winevtlog` input
  over the Fluent Forward protocol and normalize them to OCSF. Configure the
  Windows collector with `event_data_as_map true`, `string_inserts false`,
  `event_template_cache_size 256`, and a `forward` output that targets this
  listener.
---

from_fluent_bit "forward", options={
  listen: "0.0.0.0",
  port: 24224,
}
microsoft::windows::ocsf::normalize
metadata.log_format = "msgpack"
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
